[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 29940.388, "timestamp": "08:19:00", "text": "所能做到最好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29946.31, "timestamp": "08:19:06", "text": "，因為我感覺自己像個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29949.23, "timestamp": "08:19:09", "text": "被寵壞的孩子，被家人保護得很好，畢竟我是獨生子女。你知道那種外向的人走到哪裡都很外向，就像你說的，是的，我知道，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 29961.76, "timestamp": "08:19:21", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I am amazed you went through so many man"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29965.99, "timestamp": "08:19:25", "text": "所以我也想成為那樣的人，我覺得這會是一個很好的機會，至少可以朝著這個目標努力，比如去了解日本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29970.19, "timestamp": "08:19:30", "text": "。要希望能在現實生活中展現真實的自我，就像我"}]